---
interface Props {
  alt?: boolean;
}

const {alt = false} = Astro.props;
---

<section id="intro" class:list={['section', {'section--alt': alt}]}>
  <div class="container">
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Introduction</h2>
      <div class="section-accent"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="intro__body">
      My name is Trevon Romanuik. I was born and raised in Edmonton, and I am a software developer by trade.
    </p>
    <p class="intro__body">
      My platform is simple:
    </p>
    <blockquote class="intro__quote">
      I want people to spend less time getting the things they NEED so they can spend more time pursuing the things they
      WANT.
    </blockquote>
    <p class="intro__body">
      Freedom isn't free. It takes a huge number of people a huge number of hours to maintain the freedoms we take for
      granted.
      What have we done with that freedom, though? We have stood by as the rich and powerful have built a system that
      allows them to get richer and richer while the rest of us struggle to get by on less and less.
    </p>
    <p class="intro__body">
      Some people believe that the solution is to tear it all down and start anew, but I can tell you that breaking
      things is much, much easier than building them up from scratch.
      I, on the other hand, believe that if we come together in our local communities, and spend a few hours of our
      lives working for each other, we can change the system from the bottom up in a way that the billionaires and
      oligarchs can't stop.
      Remember, there are more of us than there are of them.
    </p>
    <p class="intro__body">
      How do we do that? Well let me tell you some of my ideas...
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro__body {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .intro__quote {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--navy);
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 0 1.75rem;
    margin-block: 2rem;
  }
</style>
